====================
How to run the tests
====================

sh run-server.sh #as root
# The server IP is on the last line

SERVER_IP=172.17.0.14 SERVER_IP6=172.17.0.14 make check

The bindaddr test uses numeric loopback addresses and needs no server:

make -C tests check TESTS=bindaddr

Run a sanitizer build to check that temporary resolver results are freed:

./configure CFLAGS="-O1 -g -fsanitize=address -fno-omit-frame-pointer" \
    LDFLAGS="-fsanitize=address"
make
ASAN_OPTIONS=detect_leaks=1 make -C tests check TESTS=bindaddr

